      "sections": [
        {
          "heading": "Making a plan",
          "body": "A: Are you free tomorrow?\\nB: Yes. What time is the lesson?\\nA: At seven in the evening.\\nB: Great. See you tomorrow!"
        },
        {
          "heading": "Language tip",
          "body": "نستخدم at مع وقت محدد: at seven, at nine thirty. ونستخدم on مع أيام الأسبوع: on Monday."
        }
